{"headword":"רֶ֫שַׁע","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.14\">1 S 24:14</a></sup> <strong>wickedness</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:10\" href=\"/Micah.6.10\">Mi 6:10</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">רָ֑שַׁע</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:16\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.16\">Ec 3:16</a>; cstr. (perhaps) <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶ֫שַׁע</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:25\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.25\">7:25</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִשְׁעוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.27\">Dt 9:27</a> +, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>wickedness</em>, as violence and crime against civil law <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:16\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.16\">Ec 3:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶגְרֹף ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.4\">Is 58:4</a> <em>fist of wickedness;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">חַרְצֻבּוֹת ר׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.6\">6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.17\">Pr 4:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַטֵּה ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.11\">Ez 7:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאזְנֵי ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:11\" href=\"/Micah.6.11\">Mi 6:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹצְרוֹת ר׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:10\" href=\"/Micah.6.10\">10</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.2\">Pr 10:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרֶשַׁע</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 141:4\" href=\"/Psalms.141.4\">ψ 141:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.3\">Pr 12:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עשׂות ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.12\">16:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְשָׁעִים יֵצֵא ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.14\">1 S 24:14</a> (proverb)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>wickedness</em> of enemies: of Egypt <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.11\">Ez 31:11</a> (dub. Co; gloss Toy); <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁבֶט הר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 125:3\" href=\"/Psalms.125.3\">ψ 125:3</a> (𝔊 SS <span dir=\"rtl\">רָשָׁע</span>)."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>wickedness</em>, in ethical relations: ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חטאת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.27\">Dt 9:27</a> (D<sup>2</sup>); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עון</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.20\">Je 14:20</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עולה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:13\" href=\"/Hosea.10.13\">Ho 10:13</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶדֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:8\" href=\"/Psalms.45.8\">ψ 45:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱמֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.7\">Pr 8:7</a>; v. also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:5\" href=\"/Psalms.5.5\">ψ 5:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:15\" href=\"/Psalms.10.15\">10:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:10\" href=\"/Job.34.10\">Jb 34:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 35:8\" href=\"/Job.35.8\">35:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:25\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.25\">Ec 7:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 8:8\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.8.8\">8:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:8\" href=\"/Job.34.8\">Jb 34:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָהֳלֵי ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:11\" href=\"/Psalms.84.11\">ψ 84:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּב מֵרִשְׁעוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.19\">Ez 3:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.12\">33:12</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רִשְׁעָה\" href=\"/BDB,_רִשְׁעָה\", dir=\"rtl\">רִשְׁעָה</a> <strong>3</strong>)."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB09569","strong_numbers":["7562"],"next_hw":"רָשַׁע","prev_hw":"רָשָׁע","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["8400"],"TWOT":["2222a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary",